<br/>
<h4>AES Sections are active around the world and provide a means for members to meet locally.</h4>
<br />
<br />
<p>Section meetings may be held annually or even monthly and consist of anything from presentations by specialists to facility or factory tours to social events.</p>
<br />
<p><i>Also includes Student Sections</i></p>
<br />
<br/ >
<a class="menu-button" href="https://aes.org/community/aes-sections-wordwide/" target="_blank" >Find your AES Section</a>
<br />
<br />
